OL,3,GNEWSATransition from Agilysis IT
OL,4,Acontract has cost #4m
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's States has revealed it has
OL,7,Fspent almost #4m on its transition from
OL,8,Fthe IT contract with Agilisys to its
OL,9,Fnew multi-vendor model.
OL,11,FThe figures, disclosed in responses to
OL,12,FFreedom of Information requests, show
OL,13,F#652,000 has been paid to law firms,
OL,14,Fwhilst the transition project has cost
OL,15,Fin total around #3.3m.
OL,17,FStates officials said this work had
OL,18,F"reduced the cost to the public purse
OL,19,Fby avoiding projected exit and
OL,20,Ftransition costs of approximately #5m".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
