OL,3,GNEWSATransition from Agilysis IT
OL,4,Acontract has cost #4m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAgilisys' contract with the States was
OL,7,Faxed last year, halfway through its
OL,8,F10-year tenure, with the States saying
OL,9,Fa multi-vendor model would provide
OL,10,Fbetter value for money for taxpayers.
